v4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (New), American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":5},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"American (New), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","review_id":"th6uZI5GWpmUlx14-dTBtA","date":"2016-08-17T14:22:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9415911436080933,"text_excerpt":"We first headed out to Houston's because of the Bon Appetit profile. Andrew Knowlton absolutely gushed about this restaurant group, and was mystified by his and current culinary stars' love of a chain restaurant. While we avoid chains like the plague here at home, we had to see what all of the fuss was about. I honestly cannot even express how amazing this place is. We strolled in, fairly casual, on a Saturday for lunch and were seated immediately. I was nervous about the summery casualness of my outfit, but no one looked at me twice in there other than to smile and say hello. Within two seconds, a server was at our table to take our drink order. I ordered a French 75, and my husband aske..."},{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","review_id":"1OAmbcbGzK3rpWm_UlbRNQ","date":"2014-04-01T05:12:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9387117028236389,"text_excerpt":"I moved to New Orleans almost a year ago. What took me so long to finally eat at Houston's?!! Houston's exudes class, a trait apparent as soon as you first enter the restaurant. I'm not generally a sucker for decor and ambiance, but Houston's is classy in a genuine, classic, understated way. We sat and ordered drinks. I ordered a delicious red wine (I forget which one, but assume the whole wine list is great, as everyone at the table seriously loved their wine choice). I started with the caesar salad. Such a classic presentation. Fresh, crisp romaine, topped with house-prepared caesar dressing. Light anchovy flavor masked with subtle lemon. All topped with a delicious grated parmesan and ..."},{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","review_id":"w4QHhL-iYp2JK8i6oEPhOQ","date":"2013-07-22T17:41:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9382185935974121,"text_excerpt":"Houston's is one of my favorite restaurants in New Orleans. You rarely need a reservation except there's the occasional nights when it's very packed, which in that case it's nice to order drinks at the bar and wait to be seated. The waiters are all very nice. I love waiting to be seated and being able to look into the kitchen, watching all the chefs hard at work. Houston's is one of the restaurants where you become hooked on a couple of dishes and can't seem to stray away from there. For example, I love the Spinach and Artichoke dip. It's a great appetizer. The burgers are underrated in my opinion. The salads are a great size and delicious. I also enjoy the crab cakes."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","photo_id":"DAzU928H4LK5LjHyz1Sy9g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/DAzU928H4LK5LjHyz1Sy9g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8897098898887634},{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","photo_id":"-iStZhRPFobomEOw0Hk2JQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/-iStZhRPFobomEOw0Hk2JQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8804843425750732},{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","photo_id":"C2XNVgbzbDWhtz2WzLssWA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/C2XNVgbzbDWhtz2WzLssWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8636553287506104},{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","photo_id":"75x-qzeKRzVJ9SQh1v3GFg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/75x-qzeKRzVJ9SQh1v3GFg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8567211627960205},{"business_id":"dbli0TD6YQfbnWTv-43KLg","photo_id":"qqsliC1xg0XC7PrpC3UiOQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/qqsliC1xg0XC7PrpC3UiOQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7296109795570374}]},"notebook_case":null}
